  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 210°C. Spread the courgette, pepper, onion and tomatoes on a tray, toss with 2 tbsp oil and salt, and roast for 25 minutes.",
    "Put the couscous in a bowl, pour over the hot stock, cover with a plate and leave for 8 minutes, then fluff with a fork.",
    "Fold the chickpeas, lemon zest and juice, remaining oil and chopped herbs through the couscous.",
    "Tip in the roasted vegetables along with any pan juices and gently combine.",
    "Taste, adjust the seasoning and serve warm or at room temperature."
  ],
  "notes": "Add a handful of toasted flaked almonds for crunch, or crumble over some vegan feta. Travels brilliantly for picnics and lunchboxes."
